 .
 Upstream attribution for projects SMF Works does not own is in NOTICE,
 THIRD_PARTY.md, and CREDITS.md. The source package does not vendor
 third-party Python trees. It does ship six MIT pack-data directories
 under packs/regulated (pack.json, knowledge.md, and each repository's
 LICENSE and NOTICE). Their Python and dashboard JavaScript are not
 included. See THIRD_PARTY.md. The binary package built by
 packaging/deb/build-deb.sh bundles the locked runtime wheels from PyPI
 into /opt/praxis-prime under each project's own license. Those
 distributions keep their licenses under each *.dist-info directory and
 are listed in /usr/share/doc/praxis-prime/python-licenses.txt. CREDITS.md
 is installed beside this file. They are not relicensed as MIT.
